PE 827: Pseudoprime Nimbers / 伪素数Nim

=== Background ===
Pseudoprime: composite number passing primality tests.
Nimber/Grundy: value in impartial combinatorial game theory.
A 'pseudoprime nimber' is a composite number whose Nim-value
has a property characteristic of primes in the game.

=== Fermat Pseudoprimes (base 2) ===
